## Corrections applied to the final deliverable

- C1 (numeric error, corrected). Research proposal section 7.2 claimed "2 h at 48 kHz mono is about 6.7 M frames, giving about 26.4k min/max points, about 106 KB". Correct: 2 h at 48 kHz is 345,600,000 frames; at 256 samples/point that is 1,350,000 points, about 5.4 MB (5.15 MiB) as int16 min/max pairs. The design conclusion (trivially small per-source cache) is unchanged. Verified by witness FW3 (exec-w43eak5o).
- C2 (behavior made explicit). The nearest-millisecond display rule shows 02:00:00.000 for a position one frame before two hours; timecodes are therefore display-only claims and cannot serve as anchors. Verified by FW2 rev 2 (exec-hg56emxu); FW2 rev 1 (exec-78dc_jg2) failed because my own expected constants were wrong (half-second mistaken for half-millisecond probes); both receipts disclosed.
- C3 (validation sharpened). audiowaveform's own shouldReportErrorIfSizeMismatch test shows a declared-size mismatch in a .dat file is tolerated (load returns true with a warning). Ledgerline's cache/manifest validators must therefore be stricter than upstream precedent: any header, count, or size violation is a fatal cache miss with rebuild, never a tolerated load. Evidence: S07 test capture.
- C4 (new pinned facts). libsndfile command.html captured (ee59248c...): SFC_GET_BROADCAST_INFO / SFC_SET_BROADCAST_INFO are documented at the pinned docs version (upgrades lead L03), and SFC_RF64_AUTO_DOWNGRADE ("Set auto downgrade from RF64 to WAV") exists, so an oversized export must explicitly disable silent downgrade and fail loudly instead. libsamplerate api_misc.html captured (cbb39118...): SRC_SINC_MEDIUM_QUALITY = 1 documented with SNR 97 dB and 90 percent bandwidth, pinning the resampler-quality choice's named constant. CHANGELOG v1.5.1 "Fixed buffer overflow error in MP3 decoder" adds lossy-handling caution evidence for lead L11.
- C5 (design-relevant DSP fact). Equal-power (cos/sin) crossfades drive a summed in-phase full-scale signal to 1.414 peak, so an export clipping census is required for honest boundary treatment. Verified by FW4 (exec-tbwyokfw).
- C6 (strengthening). Fresh check FW1 (exec-0myc811x) independently reproduces the research mapping numbers (4,516 of 4,547 probes fail roundtrip at 44.1k to 48k) and adds the exact structure: roundtrip succeeds if and only if the source offset is divisible by 147 (= 44100 / gcd(44100, 48000)). Cue anchoring in source samples remains the only safe design.

